The identity check correctly caught a surface-syntax mismatch: `solution.mpy` uses empty list slots, while the entry claim spelled the equivalent `.Stmts` explicitly. I’m changing only the entry claim’s program literal to the translator’s exact emitted form so the check becomes byte-structure reproducible, not merely a manual semantic comparison.
apply patch
